<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 1.5 bln French franc 12-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 1.5 bln French franc 12-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FRF   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    17.JUL.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.41     PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    99.41     SPREAD	+38 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K)*10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED OATS</p>
<p> NOTES     *REDENOMINATION INTO EUROS AFTER EMU.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
